Consider, 初, Inspector Jacques Clouseau 。, イ of no less than eleven Pink Panther films. Deaf,
dumb, and blind 后 incompetence, Clouseau obsesses on perfection. He
devotes every compulsive waking hour れcoming 報’s ultimate
